.TH achilterm "1" "November 2026" "achilterm 0.30" "User commands"
.SH NAME
Achilterm \- Web based terminal written in python

.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBAchilterm\fR is a lightweight \fBUTF\-8\fR web based terminal written in python and some AJAX
javascript for client side.
.br
Achilterm supports Python 3.11 and above.
.br
It can use almost any web browser and even works through firewalls.
.br
It runs in the foreground. To keep it running, use a service manager such as
systemd, or nohup.

.SH USAGE
\fBachilterm\fR [options]

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show the version number and exit.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show a help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-p\fR \fIPORT\fR, \fB\-\-port\fR=\fIPORT\fR
Set the TCP port (default: 8022).
.TP
\fB\-c\fR \fICMD\fR, \fB\-\-command\fR=\fICMD\fR
Set the command to run (default: /bin/login when run as root, otherwise
ssh localhost).
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-log\fR
Log requests to standard error (default: quiet).
.TP
\fB\-i\fR \fIINDEX_FILE\fR, \fB\-\-index\fR=\fIINDEX_FILE\fR
Serve this file as the main page in place of the bundled achilterm.html. In
it, %(width)s and %(height)s are replaced by the terminal size, and a literal
percent sign must be written as %%.
.TP
\fB\-w\fR \fIWIDTH\fR, \fB\-\-width\fR=\fIWIDTH\fR
Set the terminal width (default: 80).
.TP
\fB\-H\fR \fIHEIGHT\fR, \fB\-\-height\fR=\fIHEIGHT\fR
Set the terminal height (default: 25).
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR=\fITIMEOUT\fR
Close a terminal when no browser has asked for its screen for this many seconds
(default: 300, at least 90). A new terminal that has been asked for only once is
closed after 90 seconds.
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-host\fR=\fINAME\fR
Also accept requests for this host name; repeat for more names. Only localhost
is accepted otherwise.

